        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2045, Empire Arch Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Empire Arch Pocket Door Privacy Set is a great example of transitional decor. This arched sliding door set is a privacy function which means that it latches but does not lock. The interior plate has a thumbturn and the exterior plate has an emergency release turn. The Empire Arch Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware has a 1/8 inch projection and will fit doors 1-3/8 inches or 1-3/4 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/empire-arch-pocket-door-dummy-set-emtek-2046\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/empire-arch-pocket-door-passage-set-emtek-2044\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/empire-arch-pocket-door-keyed-entry-emtek-2043\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Privacy Arched Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Finger Grab Dimensions: 7/8\"w x 2\"h</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise faceplate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2045-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262426\"><b>Emtek 2045 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a privacy mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
